> > Do polymorphs have a time limit? I was poly'd into a vamp lord and
> > rather suddenly turned back into my ho-hum elven wizard self. I thought
> > you only returned to your old form when your hp reached 0.

They last a random number of turns, or until you are reduced to zero HP in
that form (in which case you revert to your normal form).

If you are wearing an amulet of unchanging, you never spontaneously revert
to natural form.  Note, too, that if you are wearing an amulet of unchanging
and are slain in your poly'd form, you die!




